msgid ""
"Edit the menu structure as JSON. Each item can have: name, icon, command "
"(run through the shell) or action (a session action: lock, logout, leave, "
"switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (array of items), "
"or separator (true)."
msgstr ""
"Editatu menuaren egitura JSON gisa. Elementu bakoitzak hauek izan ditzake: "
"name, icon, command (shell-aren bidez exekutatua) edo action (saio-ekintza "
"bat: lock, logout, leave, switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), "
"submenu (elementuen array bat) edo separator (true)."

